                <note rend="inline" type="source">738.3915/349: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Frost</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-07-30T17:00:00-04:40"><hi rendition="#italic">July 30, 1928—5
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 8:55 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>45. Informal agreement on the Haitian boundary question was signed today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Frost</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
